  "content": "\n\n<!-- Top banner/divider (centered) -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283693/description_4d7ce501-4ea4-4e42-a5b8-cfd68c7adcec.png\" width=\"850\" alt=\"\">\n</p>\n\n<!-- ICONS: rock-solid centering via table -->\n<table align=\"center\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:0 12px; text-align:center;\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/alien-evolution-first-person-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283693/description_32d76132-c575-49a8-84c0-c61d82fd4206.png\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" alt=\"Modrinth\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td style=\"padding:0 12px; text-align:center;\">\n      <a href=\"https://discord.gg/7yFQGexMn8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283693/description_36d6235e-d79c-46a2-b176-33fc481d3870.png\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" alt=\"Discord\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td style=\"padding:0 12px; text-align:center;\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alien-evolution-first-person-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n        <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283693/description_bb63ba1d-5f20-4c53-be88-e1510e226f89.png\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" alt=\"CurseForge\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<!-- Small divider (centered) | BANNER #1 -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283693/description_24a4c720-e0b7-4b40-876b-fdbb5091f1f0.png\" width=\"850\" alt=\"\">\n</p>\n\n***\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>第一人稱模型</strong>與<strong>異種進化</strong>是兩個非常棒的模組，但它們之間存在嚴重的不相容問題。當同時使用它們時，玩家會面臨以下主要問題：</span>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">視角向下時，螢幕可能會被完全遮蔽，這取決於異形的外觀模型</span></li>\n  <li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">許多擁有獨特體型的異形會導致第一人稱渲染視角完全無法使用<span style=\"color: #236fa1;\"><br></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">\n    <span style=\"color: #72a41c;\"><strong>異種進化：第一人稱模型</strong></span><br>\n    本模組是一個相容橋接器，旨在讓這兩個絕妙的模組能夠協同運作。它會自動偵測您的異形變身狀態並相應調整相機視角，為每一種異形形態提供正確的第一人稱遊戲體驗。\n  </span>\n</blockquote>\n\n***\n\n<!-- Small divider (centered) placed AFTER the line below the sentence | BANNER #2 -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283693/description_24a4c720-e0b7-4b40-876b-fdbb5091f1f0.png\" width=\"850\" alt=\"\">\n</p>\n\n<!-- Showcase images: centered -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283693/description_ffa78d4d-d251-4fdc-abe7-36a16ebd2079.png\" width=\"850\" alt=\"\"><br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283693/description_788fb16b-49a8-4332-9b20-badfffa13a5f.png\" width=\"850\" alt=\"\"><br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283693/description_5232bd6f-be5c-4dcb-9269-80efa4ea6186.png\" width=\"850\" alt=\"\">\n</p>\n\n<!-- Small divider (centered) | BANNER #3 -->\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1283693/description_24a4c720-e0b7-4b40-876b-fdbb5091f1f0.png\" width=\"850\" alt=\"\">\n</p>\n\n<!-- Early dev note (kept) -->\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><strong><br>早期開發警告：</strong></span> 本模組目前仍在積極開發中。雖然它已能讓這些模組一起遊玩，但部分功能可能尚無法完美運作（或完全無法運作）。</span>",
